   "imp": 3,
   "at": "allobroges",
   "ja": "アルプス越え。雪と崖と山の民の襲撃のなか十五日で山を越えたハンニバルの軍は、イタリアに着いたとき歩兵二万、騎兵六千に減っていた。道をふさぐ岩は火で焼き、酢をかけて砕いたと伝えられる。",
   "en": "The crossing of the Alps. Through snow, cliffs and the attacks of the mountain peoples, Hannibal crossed in fifteen days; when he came down into Italy, twenty thousand foot and six thousand horse were left. A rock that blocked the way, the story goes, was heated with fire and split with vinegar."
  },
