   "ja": "トラシメヌス湖畔の戦い。朝霧の湖岸の細道に入った執政官フラミニウスの軍を、丘に伏せたハンニバルの軍が三方から襲った。フラミニウスは討たれ、ローマ兵一万五千が湖と岸で死んだ。",
   "en": "The battle of Lake Trasimene. The consul Flaminius led his army along the misty shore path; Hannibal's men, hidden on the hills, fell on it from three sides. Flaminius was killed and fifteen thousand Romans died on the shore and in the lake."
  },
